    - Key: nmc.scene.game
      Value: '{"stores":"BuildingDefs facing south, doors on the walk; their interiors
        are the section\u2019s rooms (stations listed per piece)","lot":"a car park
        of painted stalls, no wheel stops; ambient cars may park in any stall","docks":"each
        store\u2019s dock on its outer side, doors to the south at the store\u2019s
        floor: a truck backs in on the level (stations bay1, bay2)","yard":"one way:
        in at the yard\u2019s south gate from the lot, north through the shed, out
        at the north gate to Mill Road","lights":"the lot poles light on the lamp
        rule; the stores\u2019 signs and windows by the dark; inside always lit","flats":"BuildingDefs
        facing south to their street; each building\u2019s door on its front path;
        the terrace\u2019s four houses each their own front door and garden","street":"the
        flats\u2019 street and its stalls are reached only by the link from the lot;
        no way onto Route 91"}'
